  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **oh what a night**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [7]\n- **wonderful man**: rare: 10 archived performances [7]\n- **wonderful tonight**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [7]\n- **dancing in the moonlight**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2007-03-06.ak40.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 123 min; rated 3.67/5 by 3 [1]\n- **mmj2007-03-06.AT853RX.flac16**: source not stated; 19 songs; 123 min; rated 3/5 by 1 [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The band wore prom attire, likely coinciding with local prom night events [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2007-03-06.ak40.flac24**: taped by Joe Waldron; transferred by Joe Waldron; source: Neumann ak40 > lc3 > km100 > psp2 > 722 (24/96)(fob, din, dfc) [1]. Also: Processed in CD Wave and Sound Forge 6.0, then encoded to flac level 6 [1]\n- **mmj2007-03-06.AT853RX.flac16**: taped by Brian Meccia; transferred by Brian Meccia; source: AT853RX's>UA-5>JB3 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Mike White: [GALLERY – 40 Watt Club](https://www.40watt.com/gallery/) [8]",
